  "description": "One fateful snowy evening, Yi-hyun lays his eyes on Serin, noticing her potential as an actress. While he has ambitious plans to catapult her into stardom, Serin can't help but hide her growing feelings for him - until one day, she decides to act on it. Drowning in her newfound pleasures and fears, Serin is faced with the single most important question that keeps pricking at her heart... Does he love her?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
